---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-border-subtle bg-black text-slate-400 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10 mb-12">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Origin -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-navy flex items-center justify-center border border-gold/40">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gold" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path>
              <rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"></rect>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
            MyMail<span class="text-gold">hub</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 max-w-md leading-relaxed">
          Intake counter software built by pack-and-ship store operators. Fast label intake, automatic customer notifications, and timestamped digital signatures—without contracts, paper leases, or hardware lock-in.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
          Running on the front counter at Mailbox Plus, Willoughby, OH.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Navigation -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Product</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/how-it-works" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">How It Works</a></li>
          <li><a href="/pricing" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Pricing & ROI</a></li>
          <li><a href="/faq" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#comparison" class="hover:text-gold transition-colors">Compare vs Legacy</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Legal & Support -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Store Operator Support</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
          Have an existing customer roster to import?
        </p>
        <a 
          href="https://cal.com" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-gold hover:underline"
        >
          Book an Assisted Setup Call &rarr;
        </a>
        <div class="pt-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          Single plan: $39/month. Cancel anytime.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-border-subtle pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 gap-4">
      <p>&copy; {currentYear} MyMailhub. All rights reserved.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <span>No paper leases. No APK sideloading. No contracts.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
